			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add PostHog telemetry bridge for Wind-side events\n\nAdd Source/Telemetry/PostHogBridge.ts - a new telemetry module that enables\nWind to emit PostHog events. The bridge reuses Sky's existing window.posthog\ninstance when running in the webview (avoiding double-capture and rate-limit\nissues), with a fallback to direct HTTP POST to the /batch endpoint for\nNode.js environments (e.g., extension dev-loops).\n\nEvery event is tagged with $tier: \"wind\" so downstream analytics can filter\nby source. Provides CaptureEvent, CaptureError, and Initialize functions.\n\nAlso includes a minor style fix in LifecycleService.ts (em dash → hyphen).\n\nEnables Wind to contribute telemetry events to the unified PostHog pipeline.",
			"SHA": "d36318e9a01c4ec1eb41e6a598f2f0a15ded4568"
