			"Message": "build(Wind): Update compiled MountainImplementation.js for Channel registry migration\n\nRegenerate Target/Effect/Mountain/Implementation/MountainImplementation.js to reflect the recent Wind refactoring commits that migrated all IPC invokes to use the typed Channel registry.\n\nKey changes in compiled output:\n- `mountain_get_status` string literal replaced with `Channel.MountainGetStatus` reference\n- All other IPC channel references updated to use typed Channel imports\n- Matches the source refactoring from commits a12e2caea303, 8244ad244acd, and 86bd4240706\n\nThis ensures the built JavaScript artifacts stay synchronized with the TypeScript source refactoring that added compile-time validation for IPC channel names.",
